{"3672470": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Racket Pinball", "steam_appid": 3672470, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready to enter the electrifying world of <strong>Racket Pinball</strong>, a thrilling fusion where the excitement of <strong>pinball meets the energy of racket sports</strong> in a groundbreaking VR experience! It's more than just a game; it’s an epic journey combining classic gameplay with cutting-edge virtual reality, captivating players of all skill levels. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672470/extras/6602a765573a0673c860d4b76cf7f073.avif?t=1774549058\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672470/extras_big/6602a765573a0673c860d4b76cf7f073.avif?t=1774549058 width=800 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into visually stunning arenas that transform pinball into an immersive adventure. Picture yourself standing inside a colossal pinball machine, racket in hand, actively shaping your own game. Swing, aim, and unleash spectacular hits to trigger dazzling targets, activate mind-blowing mechanisms, and discover surprises hidden around every corner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672470/extras/4911092725df5caad4cc8d6f84fe17ff.avif?t=1774549058\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672470/extras_big/4911092725df5caad4cc8d6f84fe17ff.avif?t=1774549058 width=800 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into three uniquely themed arenas: experience thrilling pirate battles, explore cosmic frontiers in an interstellar adventure, and immerse yourself in the rugged excitement of the Wild West! Each environment bursts with vibrant visuals, immersive soundscapes, and dynamic gameplay tailored to amaze and entertain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672470/extras/fef93dbfa4a3ed76501e90484af38e5d.avif?t=1774549058\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672470/extras_big/fef93dbfa4a3ed76501e90484af38e5d.avif?t=1774549058 width=800 height=300 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're competing for the highest score, exploring themed adventures, or simply enjoying the exhilarating sensation of precision hits, Racket Pinball guarantees endless hours of fun. With intuitive, physically engaging gameplay, it’s not just entertainment, it’s a <strong>workout for your reflexes</strong> and your imagination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672470/extras/bbccf4b6f798737c89aec6330cc19920.avif?t=1774549058\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672470/extras_big/bbccf4b6f798737c89aec6330cc19920.avif?t=1774549058 width=800 height=300 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into Racket Pinball now and aim to become the ultimate pinball champion. <strong>Your adventure awaits, grab your racket and play like never before!</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready to enter the electrifying world of <strong>Racket Pinball</strong>, a thrilling fusion where the excitement of <strong>pinball meets the energy of racket sports</strong> in a groundbreaking VR experience! It's more than just a game; it’s an epic journey combining classic gameplay with cutting-edge virtual reality, captivating players of all skill levels. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672470/extras/6602a765573a0673c860d4b76cf7f073.avif?t=1774549058\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672470/extras_big/6602a765573a0673c860d4b76cf7f073.avif?t=1774549058 width=800 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into visually stunning arenas that transform pinball into an immersive adventure. Picture yourself standing inside a colossal pinball machine, racket in hand, actively shaping your own game. Swing, aim, and unleash spectacular hits to trigger dazzling targets, activate mind-blowing mechanisms, and discover surprises hidden around every corner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672470/extras/4911092725df5caad4cc8d6f84fe17ff.avif?t=1774549058\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672470/extras_big/4911092725df5caad4cc8d6f84fe17ff.avif?t=1774549058 width=800 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into three uniquely themed arenas: experience thrilling pirate battles, explore cosmic frontiers in an interstellar adventure, and immerse yourself in the rugged excitement of the Wild West! Each environment bursts with vibrant visuals, immersive soundscapes, and dynamic gameplay tailored to amaze and entertain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672470/extras/fef93dbfa4a3ed76501e90484af38e5d.avif?t=1774549058\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672470/extras_big/fef93dbfa4a3ed76501e90484af38e5d.avif?t=1774549058 width=800 height=300 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're competing for the highest score, exploring themed adventures, or simply enjoying the exhilarating sensation of precision hits, Racket Pinball guarantees endless hours of fun. With intuitive, physically engaging gameplay, it’s not just entertainment, it’s a <strong>workout for your reflexes</strong> and your imagination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672470/extras/bbccf4b6f798737c89aec6330cc19920.avif?t=1774549058\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672470/extras_big/bbccf4b6f798737c89aec6330cc19920.avif?t=1774549058 width=800 height=300 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into Racket Pinball now and aim to become the ultimate pinball champion. <strong>Your adventure awaits, grab your racket and play like never before!</strong></p>", "short_description": "A fast-paced VR fusion of pinball and racket sports! Smash your way through four vibrant arenas - Pirates, Space, Wild West, and Speed - using rackets to hit targets, trigger effects, and master thrilling challenges. Reflexes ready? Let the game begin!", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Czech, Dutch, Japanese, Polish, Portuguese - Portugal, Thai, Hungarian, Simplified Chinese, Korean", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672470/237e93a7e1797370c5b5075a7bef70f66c6b8f0b/header.jpg?t=1774549058", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672470/8d240ea27cbe3a14c031ff82070f07e6ae0a3d14/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774549058", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672470/8d240ea27cbe3a14c031ff82070f07e6ae0a3d14/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774549058", "website": "https://www.facebook.com/groups/racketpinball", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</